\label{sec:subsec22}

\end{document}
```

Note that we've added a `\label` command for each section and subsection, which will be used to link the TOC entries to their respective sections.

5. Finally, compile your LaTeX document using a tool like LaTeX, PDFLaTeX, or XeLaTeX. The resulting PDF should contain an automatically generated TOC:

```latex
