\end{ChessBoard}

\end{document}
```

This example displays a standard starting chessboard, with a black knight at e3 and a red pawn at c6.

Note that the `chessboard` package allows for various customization options, such as changing the board color, font size, and piece styles. You can find more information and examples in the package documentation.

